 image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;14)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">2</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage at the start of each turn and has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Removed by healing.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Diamond_Scales\"> Condition: Diamond Scales </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/45px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/60px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diamond Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/30px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\">Diamond Scales</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"100 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 100 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li>\n<li>While it has these temporary hit points:\n<ul><li>It is grounded.</li>\n<li>Any damage lower than 15 will not affect it.</li>\n<li>It can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shredding Scales</a> immediately after being hit for the first time in a round.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Bulette starts with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diamond Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\">Diamond Scales</a> active in Honour mode.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034825\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75475/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 29894/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser